# How the Restoration Works

Welcome to Origin.

The world was broken by the **Great Static**, leaving behind lost systems, unfinished areas, and broken pieces of the digital world.

The Restoration is how builders help put it back together.

## Chapters

The Restoration is split into chapters.

Each chapter focuses on rebuilding a different part of Origin. New challenges, sidequests, and projects appear as the world changes.

You don't need to start from the beginning though. If you join late, you haven't missed your chance. Everything is still open for you to explore.

## Operations

Inside each chapter are operations.

Operations are bigger goals that need builders to complete them. They might involve:

- Building a tool
- Solving a problem
- Creating something new
- Helping other builders

Every project helps move the Restoration forward.

