# Your Sidequest

Sidequests are challenges that give you something to build.

They usually come from problems inside Origin, with characters (NPCs) asking builders for help.

You can either:
- Pick an existing sidequest
- Create your own project

Both count.

## What makes a good sidequest?

A good sidequest is something that:

- Solves a real problem
- Shows what you built and learned
- Has your own ideas added to it
- Is more than just following a tutorial

## The one rule

Don't just copy something.

Tutorials are great for learning, but your final project should have something that makes it yours.

